{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/514c5ad796f6ac69dc1af41aeea0a5a2.avif?t=1771861373\" width=600 height=82 /></span><br><br><i><strong>Tapes of Fear: Smile</strong></i> was created with one goal: to cause as much fear as possible. This first-person psychological horror game guarantees a unique and terrifying experience with each gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/cee6dea4614e438cd74ee1acb6f1dcdd.avif?t=1771861373\" width=600 height=82 /></span><br><br>At the heart of <i>Tapes of Fear</i> is the innovative <strong>Infinity Fear System\u2122</strong>, a technology created by Infinity Green Game Studio. Developed based on academic studies on how to induce fear, this advanced system monitors your decisions and reactions in real-time, dynamically adjusting game events to maximize terror. The system ensures you never face too many or too few scares, maintaining a perfect flow of terror. Every decision and reaction alters the course of events, providing a new and terrifying experience with each playthrough.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/5a055602ff5b53290257d6c03be3ef92.poster.avif?t=1771861373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/5a055602ff5b53290257d6c03be3ef92.webm?t=1771861373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/5a055602ff5b53290257d6c03be3ef92.mp4?t=1771861373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMILE</h2><br>You are not alone in the strange house where you wake up trapped. A dark entity, always with a sinister smile, uses ducts to move between the walls, relentlessly hunting you. This enemy is relentless and adaptive, making each encounter a battle for survival. Its constant presence keeps you on high alert, and your character is entirely defenseless, forcing you to use your wits and agility to avoid being found.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/0a1adc965439f62a646745fefd6802c3.poster.avif?t=1771861373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/0a1adc965439f62a646745fefd6802c3.webm?t=1771861373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/0a1adc965439f62a646745fefd6802c3.mp4?t=1771861373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SANITY</h2><br>Maintaining your sanity is essential to survive in <i>Tapes of Fear</i>. The house is filled with disturbing events that affect your character both psychologically and physically. Find, use, and manage items that help keep your sanity stable.<br><br><strong>Prepare for a journey that will challenge your mind and courage in <i>Tapes of Fear</i>. Each playthrough is a new experience of terror, ensuring you never know exactly what to expect.</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2023540?t=1771861373","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771861373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/d94cb2de604e399052d880bfd6644375ed5c50fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771861373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/d94cb2de604e399052d880bfd6644375ed5c50fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=177